{{Term/Store|Chillfin Trout|Chillfin Trouts|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s and [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Chillfin Trout}}
Chillfin Trout can be caught by [[Link]] in the [[Water (Terrain)|Waters]] of the [[Tabantha Frontier]] and [[Hebra Mountains]]. The [[Coral Reef]] in [[Zora's Domain]] also sells them. They can be eaten raw to restore one [[Heart]] to Link. Similar to other [[Trout]]s, Chillfin Trout become [[Roasted Trout]] when exposed to [[Fire]] and [[Frozen Trout]] when chilled by [[Ice]]. When [[Cooking|Cooked]] into a [[Meal]], Chillfin Trouts provide [[Heat Resistance]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

